              "name": "h",
              "fill": "#241F1A",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "④ 判据（要能红）",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "600"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "iQOgp",
              "name": "i",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 每个可见后代的 top/bottom 落在卡片内容盒内（与已有左右判据同一形状）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "xLuW1",
              "name": "j",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 卡片自身 scrollHeight > clientHeight 即出界。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "KOJ3F",
              "name": "k",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 样本必须含 #g-webext —— 这一例正是它。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "to8RU",
              "name": "l",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 视口：12 语种 × 最窄视口之外，加一个矮视口（压扁只在窄高时发生）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
