              "content": "· 样本必须含 #systrans-steps —— 这一例正是它。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "DB0D6",
              "name": "n",
              "fill": "#8A7F72",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "· 反面样本：把一条 ol 改回默认标记，探针必须变红（否则它是一条红不了的门禁）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
