              "fontWeight": "700"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "vAHtx",
              "name": "E9 依据 1",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "识别方式（代码位置）：app/native/speech-bridge.swift —— 用 iOS 26 的 SpeechAnalyzer + SpeechTranscriber / DictationTranscriber；全仓**没有 requiresOnDeviceRecognition**（那是老 SFSpeechRecognizer 的开关，本产品不用它）；识别包由 AssetInventory 在本地安装，见 speech-bridge.swift:207 / 240 / 245 / 431 / 436。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZnZVi",
              "name": "E9 依据 2",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "翻译两条路（代码位置）：自带 key ⇒ 客户端直连你配的服务商（extension/content/translation-api.js 的传输层）；免费额度 ⇒ 经我们的中继 supabase/functions/bt-relay/index.ts —— 该文件头三条纪律写明：不改写形状、不碰内容（文本不进表不进日志，日志只有令牌 hash 前 8 位、kind、cost、ms、状态码）、模型钉死在服务端。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "a2by1",
              "name": "E9 依据 3",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "未能证实的一点：Apple 的识别是否在某些语言/机型上回落到服务端 —— 代码里看不到这个开关（SpeechAnalyzer 没有 requiresOnDeviceRecognition 这类参数），所以稿里不写「都在你的设备上处理」的绝对说法。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
