              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "I4COsM",
          "name": "④ 两种用法：按住 与 点一下（18:32 补充）",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 18,
          "stroke": "#E6E1D6",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "kfu5B",
              "name": "按住",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "按住 ≥ 约 0.4 秒：这一句按这门语言识别（不跑语种判定），松手定稿并翻译。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "sMrUc",
              "name": "点一下",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "不足 0.4 秒就松手：进入「这门语言在说」的锁定态 —— 不必一直按着。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "CejIk",
              "name": "锁定态 · 再点同一个按钮",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "结束并定稿。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "T4zOSd",
              "name": "锁定态 · 点另一个按钮",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "先把当前这句定稿，再切到那一门继续锁定。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "EQNju",
              "name": "锁定态 · 点暂停 / 结束",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "以点为准：立刻退出锁定、当前这句不落行，再走暂停 / 结束（同原稿）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Hevc1",
              "name": "锁定态的样子",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "被锁的那半边按钮填深色 + 描边变强调色 + 麦克风图标旁一个红点；按钮条上方一行小字提示怎么结束：「● 中文 正在说 · 再点一下结束」。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "BtTxa",
              "name": "提示语（保留）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "按住或锁定后都没说话 → 「没听到声音，再试一次」。原来的「按住说一整句再松手」作废。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "frame",
              "id": "wQA2T",
              "name": "我的建议：锁定后多久自动结束？",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "fill": "#FBF3EF",
              "cornerRadius": 18,
              "stroke": "#E6E1D6",
              "strokeWidth": 1,
              "layout": "vertical",
              "gap": 8,
              "padding": 16,
              "children": [
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "v9TtXg",
                  "name": "建议",
                  "fill": "#2B2B2B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "连续 8 秒没有声音 → 自动定稿并退出锁定。",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "NGJCX",
                  "name": "理由",
                  "fill": "#2B2B2B",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "锁定态会让「自动识别」一直让位，用户忘了退出就会觉得 App 不听了、像卡住；8 秒是「说完了」的常见停顿，远短于现有 30 秒静默暂停 —— 既不会打断正在想下一句的人，也不会让状态一直挂着。这个秒数我做成可调常量，实测后再定。",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "normal"
                },
                {
                  "type": "text",
                  "id": "tFm3R",
                  "name": "已定：8 秒",
                  "fill": "#B0533F",
                  "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                  "width": "fill_container",
                  "content": "18:34 已定：8 秒。做成可调常量 pttSilenceMs，默认 8000（回归里可改成 1500 ms 跑单测）。",
                  "fontFamily": "Inter",
                  "fontSize": 13,
                  "fontWeight": "600"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "frame",
          "id": "Hcc6v",
          "name": "⑤ 18:34 的六条修订（都已定，无待定）",
          "width": "fill_container",
          "fill": "#FFFFFF",
          "cornerRadius": 18,
          "stroke": "#E6E1D6",
          "strokeWidth": 1,
          "layout": "vertical",
          "gap": 8,
          "padding": 16,
          "children": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h4ayH",
              "name": "锁定后静音自动结束（已定）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "连续 8 秒没有声音 → 自动定稿并退出锁定。理由：锁定态让自动识别一直让位，忘了退出会觉得 App 不听了；8 秒是「说完了」的常见停顿，远短于 30 秒静默暂停。常量 pttSilenceMs，默认 8000。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "AWrRm",
              "name": "灰掉的原因（18:34 已定）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "未开始、已暂停，两个按钮都灰掉，就近显示一句：「点「开始听」后可用」。暂停后主按钮上写的就是「开始听」（听的时候它是「● 正在听 · 暂停」），所以同一句两种情况都成立。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "A5wuyY",
              "name": "「正在听」怎么写那门语言（18:34 已定）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "规则：「正在听」+ 本名 +「…」；本名不是中日韩文字时，中间加一个空格。例：正在听中文… / 正在听 ไทย… / 正在听 English…。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "p6uc8b",
              "name": "锁定提示行同理（18:34 已定）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "「●」+ 本名 +「正在说 · 再点一下结束」；非中日韩文字加空格。例：● 中文 正在说 · 再点一下结束 / ● ไทย 正在说 · 再点一下结束。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "bKn82",
              "name": "两指同时按（18:34 已定）",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "以先按下的为准；后按下的那个忽略 —— 不切换、不报错、不落行。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
