              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "R4 录音中该键实心高亮 + 小字「● 正在录 · 点一下结束」；另一个键照常可点（点了 = 先定稿这边、再开始那边）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
