              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "R6 「结束」去掉。离开页面（‹ 返回）＝结束整场；离开时若还在录音，先弹一次确认（沿用现有那句）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
