            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "h4C2t4",
              "name": "控制区",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "控制区 = **一个胶囊**：左段 ［ English ］ ⇄ ［ 中文 ］（两个 select 包在同一个圆角胶囊里，中间那个 ⇄ 既是分隔也是一眼看出「一对」）；右侧靠两个图标开关：🔊 朗读 / ○ 不留记录。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VxTT9",
              "name": "键",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "两个键 = 高 64 · 圆角 22 · 未录音 --sage-light(#e1eecc) 描边 --border；**录音态实心 --accent(#ac6231)**、白字。大字 = 麦克风图标（内联 SVG，单色跟随文字色）+ 语言本名；小字 = 界面语言的「点一下开始」/「● 正在录 · 点一下停」。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "SPhC2",
              "name": "色",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "颜色全用调色板真实 token：--accent #ac6231（录音态）/ --sage-light #e1eecc（未录音）/ --border #dcd3c4 / --text #201e1d / --text-secondary #6a6255。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Bmh1N",
              "name": "注",
              "fill": "#8A8578",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "只动视觉与排布；交互一字不改（点一下开 / 点一下停、无按住、无静音自动停、收音才开麦）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 12,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "pbrDk",
              "name": "追加",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "8. 宽版两个键**竖排**（各占满左栏宽，各 64 高）—— 并排时每个只有约 117pt，小字「● 正在录 · 点一下停」会挤成两行并顶到底边（Mac 真机截图实测）。窄版仍并排贴底。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
