              "id": "e0ZOaO",
              "name": "标题",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "定稿要点（照这个改代码 + 写进规范）",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 15,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Q7Q3A7",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "1. 删顶部那行重复的语言行（langLineText）—— 语言对只由胶囊表达（宽窄两版都删）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "Pqdys",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "2. 两个键只在左栏内（宽版；约 250pt），不再是通栏横幅；窄版仍贴底通栏。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "q4g8E",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "3. 宽版左栏固定 ~250pt；右栏吃掉剩余，现在卡与定稿卡都在各自栏内。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "VhPqh",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "4. 现在卡在宽版收成紧凑两行（不再 calc(100vh-250px) 撑满）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "ZFpll",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "5. 「线上会议…」收到标题下一行小字（只 Mac）。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "uRaFj",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "6. 图标统一单色内联 SVG（话筒 / 喇叭），不用 emoji。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "id": "fUkPP",
              "name": "行",
              "fill": "#2B2B2B",
              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
              "width": "fill_container",
              "content": "7. 断点仍是 720px（窗口宽度）；iPad 分屏自然回落窄版，不为 iPad 另写布局。",
              "fontFamily": "Inter",
              "fontSize": 13,
              "fontWeight": "normal"
            }
          ]
        }
